functor","target_term":"函子","context":"景的比较"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续","context":"函子性质"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"比较态射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"景的比较"},{"source_term":"underlying presheaves","target_term":"底层预层","context":"函子作用"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"比较对象"},{"source_term":"sheafification","target_term":"层化","context":"h 拓扑下的层化"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"小平展景"},{"source_term":"fibre products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"连续性检验"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"连续性检验"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"函子保持运算"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"章节引用"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EW8:statement","translation":"沿用上面的记号。设<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>上的层（sheaf）。规则\n<MATH_0003>\n是层（sheaf），因而更是<MATH_0004>上的层（sheaf）。事实上，此层（sheaf）等于<MATH_0005>，在<MATH_0006>上；也等于<MATH_0007>，在<MATH_0008>上。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"规则在两种拓扑下的层性质"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EW8:proof","translation":"关于平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology）的陈述就是引理<REF_0001>的内容。为完成证明，只需证明<MATH_0001>对于 h 拓扑（topology）是层（sheaf）。然而，在引理<REF_0002>中已证明<MATH_0002>甚至对于更强的 ph 拓扑（topology）也是层（sheaf）。\n","allowed_english":["h","ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"拓扑名称"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"层条件的比较"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"所证性质"}],"notes":[]}
